#. i18n: file: lib/gwenviewconfig.kcfg:38
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (BlackListedExtensions), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:239
msgid ""
"A list of filename extensions Gwenview should not try to\n"
"\t\t\tload. This is useful to exclude raw files which are recognized as\n"
"\t\t\tTIFF or JPEG. We exclude *.new as well because this is the extension\n"
"\t\t\tused for temporary files by KSaveFile."
msgstr ""
"En List vun Dateiverwiedern, de Gwenview nich laden schall.\n"
"\t\t\tSo laat sik Rohdateien utsluten, de as TIFF- oder JPEG-Dateien\n"
"\t\t\tkennt warrt. Ok \"*.new\" warrt utslaten: Disse Verwiedern bruukt\n"
"\t\t\tKSaveFile för't Sekern vun Temporeerdateien."

